# Accessibility

Use native semantics, programmatic names, visible focus, logical keyboard
behavior, non-color status cues, announced dynamic changes, and text
alternatives. Test applicable states with axe, a keyboard-only primary path,
contrast evidence, and 320px reflow. A skipped required check blocks completion.

